{"id":13,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"ا<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">لٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">مٓ</span>ر‌ۚ تِلْكَ ءَايَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكِتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بِ‌ۗ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> أُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نز</span>ِلَ إِلَيْكَ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ر</span>َّبِّكَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقُّ وَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ أَكْثَرَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َاسِ لَا يُؤْمِن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"ٱللَّهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى رَفَعَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ بِغَيْرِ عَمَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">دٍ ت</span>َرَوْنَهَا‌ۖ ثُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَوَىٰ عَلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَرْشِ‌ۖ وَسَخَّرَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّمْسَ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَمَرَ‌ۖ كُ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">لٌّ ي</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>رِى لِأَجَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">لٍ م</span>ُّسَم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ًّى‌ۚ ي</span>ُدَبِّرُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَمْرَ يُفَصِّلُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِ لَعَلَّك<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم 