ligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>ئِكَ لَهُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>لَّعْنَةُ وَلَهُمْ س<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُو</span>ٓءُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>دّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span>رِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٥</span>"},{"id":26,"tajweed":"ٱللَّهُ يَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>سُطُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رِّزْقَ لِم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ وَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>دِرُ‌ۚ وَفَرِحُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">و</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ٰ</span>ةِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>دُّنْيَا وَمَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">و</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ٰ</span>ةُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>دُّنْيَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَخِرَةِ إِلَّا مَتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ـٰ</span>عٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٦</span>"},{"id":27,"tajweed":"وَيَقُولُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لَوْل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نز</span>ِلَ عَلَيْهِ ءَايَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٌ م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ر</span>َّبِّه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span>‌ۗ قُلْ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ يُضِلُّ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ وَيَهْد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</s