ible\">َا</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٨</span>"},{"id":39,"tajweed":"يَمْحُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ مَا يَش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ وَيُثْبِتُ‌ۖ وَعِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ند</span>َهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ</span> أُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>ُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكِتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٩</span>"},{"id":40,"tajweed":"وَإ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن م</span>َّا نُرِيَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َكَ بَعْضَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى نَعِدُهُمْ أَوْ نَتَوَفَّيَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َكَ فَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َمَا عَلَيْكَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>غُ وَعَلَيْنَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحِس<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٠</span>"},{"id":41,"tajweed":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا نَأْتِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضَ نَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نق</span>ُصُهَا مِنْ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">طْ</span>رَافِهَا‌ۚ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ يَحْكُمُ لَا مُعَقِّبَ لِحُكْمِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span>‌ۚ وَهُوَ سَرِيعُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحِس<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤١</span>"},{"id":42,"tajweed":"وَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> مَكَرَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لِهِمْ فَلِلَّه